    {
      "text": "Site spans E. O'Keefe St, Euclid Ave and Manhattan Ave. The full APN list is in a city attachment not read here; the parcel on this record is the listed site address only.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001174"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "AB 130 memo (Nov. 2026): 41 parcels on about 14.7 acres bounded by West Bayshore Rd and Donohoe St, Manhattan Ave and Woodland Ave. Townhome component demolishes 109 existing units (21 properties) and builds 114 for-sale townhomes (186,103 sq ft). Seven existing apartment buildings (221 units, 148,913 sq ft) are renovated with 7 units added. New-building component demolishes 239 existing units (11 properties) and builds 729 rental units in four buildings (277,176 sq ft): 385 net new and 349 replacement. Memo states 506 net-new units overall.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Requested approvals: design review, tree removal permit (about 270 on-site trees removed, about 472 planted), conditional use permit for demolition of rent-stabilized units, vesting tentative map, and AB 130 CEQA exemption determination.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002036"
      ]
    },
